blocks.en:
Figure 2 : Attention patterns and video–action inference strategies. (a) Action generation from the current observation only;
(b) history-conditioned action generation without future prediction;
(c) joint video–action co-denoising (CoD);
(d) video prediction followed by action denoising (IDM).
IDM conditions actions on both observed history and predicted future latents,
reusing visual KV across action-denoising steps.

blocks.zh:
图2:关注模式和视频-行动推断战略。 (a) 仅从目前的观察中产生行动;
(b) 以历史为条件、不作未来预测的行动生成;
(c) 联合录像-行动共同报道;
(d) 视频预测,然后是动作去名(IDM)。
IDM为观察历史和预测未来潜在因素的行动提供了条件,
重复使用视觉 KV 跨动作识别步骤。

